{"c":[{"id":"9eb8c86cfea56fc0","sum":"G2: note short lines go whole before clauses; date/email/phone partAround clauses charge first only outside chats (earlier, canned 316->308). Canned page-loop evals answer owners from fixtures/web-form/owners.json, else unclear 0.5; a page with no entry throws.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261007T034441Z-339e891dadd6a49a","text":"G2: a note's short lines go out whole and spend its budget before any clause; date/email/phone clause parts (partAround) are charged before other lines only outside conversations; earlier charging cut emails and names (guard-adversary canned 316 -> 308/314).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261007T034441Z-3d8738b69dcb6bd3","text":"G2: canned page-loop evals answer fill's ownership questions from fixtures/web-form/owners.json (W4: ~/.caret-run/evidence/browser/w4/replay/owners.json), unclear 0.5 elsewhere; a canned run throws for a page with no entry.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"eafc5c507969e166","sum":"W2/I1: every page write needs a CheckedValue (fill/contract.ts checkValues/mintExempt) or compilers throw ContractError; provenanceStale is the one source recheck and lines [] never holds, so hand-built test mints use test/mint.ts minted(p, model).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261007T050339Z-4d8696f9c3182cf8","text":"W2: every page write needs a CheckedValue from helper/src/fill/contract.ts (checkValues or mintExempt); compilers (fillPlan, validatePlan, GoalRuns.propose, patterns plan) throw ContractError without one. Proposals built by hand in tests go through test/mint.ts.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261007T091312Z-bde14560b8505461","text":"I1: the only source recheck is fill/contract.ts provenanceStale (G2's sourceHolds merged in, deleted); a window Provenance needs lines = lineDigests of the text Jev judged, and lines [] is never held, so hand-built test mints pass a model (test/mint.ts minted(p, model)).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
